                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction>],
                                    [<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> usability:Event ; 
                                     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> usability:contains ; 
